  "description": "UDM-SE WAN traffic split into IPv4 / IPv6. Counters read from the UDM over SSH every minute by udm_v4v6 on the SIEM server and exported through Alloy's textfile collector (docs/udm-v4v6.md). Unpoller cannot split by IP family.",
